<title>USA: Lukens raising stainless prices in May.</title>
<headline>Lukens raising stainless prices in May.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lukens Inc will raise prices on its flat-rolled stainless steel products by 5 percent effective with May 5 shipments, a spokesman said Thursday.</p>
<p>The price hike follows an announcement on Wednesday by Allegheny Teledyne Inc, which said it will raise stainless prices by the same amount on the same date.</p>
<p>Other producers including Armco Inc and J&amp;L Specialty Steel Inc told Reuters they were studying the increase.</p>
<p>((Pittsburgh newsroom 412-471-7088))</p>
